  "description": "Barcode for ASP.NET Core on SkiaSharp is a C# barcode generator library for ASP.NET Core web app. You can easily create, generate QR Code, Data Matrix, Code 128, Code 39 barcode formats in ASP.NET Core C# class, or create barcodes through URL in ASP.NET Core web app.\n\nThe C# barcode library depends on SkiaSharp package.\n\nBarcode for ASP.NET library can be used in C#, VB.NET, ASP.NET Core, Framework, MVC, website, web app and web service applications.\n\nSupported barcode formats :\n* QR Code (Steyled QR Code, GS1 version), Data Matrix (GS1 version), PDF-417\n* Code 39, Code 128, GS1-128\n* EAN 8, EAN 13, UPC-A, UPC-E, +2, +5 supplemental codes\n* Interleaved 2 of 5, ITF-14\n* And other barcodes\n\nOutput :\n* Raster images: bitmap (.bmp), gif, png, jpeg/jpg, tiff\n* Vector images: svg, eps\n* Stream objects or binary data\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6\n\nOnline Documents\n* C# How to Guide : https://www.barcodelib.com/csharp/\n* Licenses : https://www.barcodelib.com/purchase/license-barcode-net.html\n* Email : support@barcodelib.com",
